            "Warning: SVG layout prompts/screen/mismatch.prompt.md -> prompts/screen/mismatch.ui.svg: label \"READY\": drawing label absent from prompt.",
            "Warning: SVG layout prompts/screen/mismatch.prompt.md -> prompts/screen/mismatch.ui.svg: region #score: drawing region layout unspecified in prompt."
